<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#0A0A0A;">Offerta non approvata</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">Keus non ha approvato l'offerta per {{companyName}} sull'ordine <strong style="font-weight:600;">{{orderCode}}</strong>.</p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FAF7F2" style="background-color:#FAF7F2;border:1px solid #E7E1D8;border-radius:10px;">
<tr>
<td style="padding:16px 20px 8px 20px;font-size:12px;color:#817B78;">Motivo</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding:0 20px 16px 20px;font-size:15px;color:#0A0A0A;">{{reason}}</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:24px 0 0 0;">L'ordine torna a te: correggilo e chiedi di nuovo l'approvazione.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:28px 0 0 0;">
<tr>
<td class="rk-btn" ${button_cell}>
<a href="{{orderUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Apri l'ordine</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
